    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0707" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg687"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-08-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 20, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Referring to your note of the 13th
                    instant, and to my reply of the 18th in regard to the modification of the
                    executive order of the President of the United States of the 14th of April,
                    1862, I have the honor to enclose, for your lordship’s information and use,
                    three printed copies of an instruction of the 17th instant, issued by the Acting
                    Secretary of the Treasury to the proper officers on the subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient,
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d468-a1.xml" xpointer="d468-a1"/>
            </div>
